WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.960
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.000 --> 01:35.360
That is her mother?

01:36.120 --> 01:37.600
No, her mother-in-law.

01:40.120 --> 01:42.480
Tell her to come for a quiet cultivation
to accumulate blessings.

01:42.560 --> 01:45.160
Have her come see me alone later.

01:46.480 --> 01:47.320
Understood.

01:48.360 --> 01:50.120
What a poor child.

01:50.840 --> 01:52.800
I've heard about your problem.

01:52.880 --> 01:54.320
This is a tribulation destined for you.

01:54.400 --> 01:56.040
I shouldn't interfere,

01:56.560 --> 01:58.160
but I truly feel sorry for you.

01:58.240 --> 02:01.720
Fairy, please save my husband.

02:03.320 --> 02:05.800
This isn't about saving your husband.

02:05.880 --> 02:08.000
It's about saving you.

02:08.080 --> 02:11.560
Lady Yue speaks very tactfully.

02:12.760 --> 02:16.560
She told Wan
that Sun Renyi was seriously ill

02:16.640 --> 02:19.080
due to the tribulation destined for her.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.720
She basically said

02:22.400 --> 02:24.800
that Sun Renyi was dying because of Wan

02:24.880 --> 02:27.560
and only Wan could save him.

02:27.640 --> 02:29.400
Lady Yue also said

02:29.480 --> 02:34.200
that many wealthy families
were having children through surrogacy,

02:34.280 --> 02:35.680
and if Wan's Four Pillars of Destiny

02:35.760 --> 02:38.760
happened to align
with those of someone wealthy

02:38.840 --> 02:42.880
and she could give birth to a child
at the auspicious hour,

02:43.920 --> 02:45.800
she would receive a substantial reward.

02:47.400 --> 02:50.000
This money could save her husband.

02:50.600 --> 02:53.960
And that wealthy man turned out
to be Wu Siping.

03:11.920 --> 03:14.800
Wan was well taken care of in the manor.

03:15.520 --> 03:16.720
Sun Renyi

03:17.680 --> 03:21.600
received medicinal herbs quite on time.

03:22.480 --> 03:25.400
Wan thought things would end like this.

03:25.480 --> 03:26.400
Very stable.

03:26.480 --> 03:27.720
However,

03:27.800 --> 03:31.280
more than two weeks before the due date,

03:31.360 --> 03:34.160
Lady Yue sent her a bowl of medicine.

03:34.240 --> 03:37.880
This isn't the usual medicine.

03:38.760 --> 03:41.240
They changed the medicine
because the due date is approaching.

03:54.720 --> 03:55.720
Harder.

03:56.440 --> 03:58.960
In an hour, I want to hear the child cry.

03:59.040 --> 04:00.640
Understood.

04:01.480 --> 04:02.920
Push harder.

04:04.880 --> 04:07.320
You can guess what happened after.

04:08.160 --> 04:11.400
They fed Wan a lot of Tuohua Decoction.

04:12.160 --> 04:16.279
She gave birth to a child
at the exact time they wanted.

04:18.200 --> 04:19.079
Here's the baby.

04:20.959 --> 04:22.000
Hurry.

04:22.079 --> 04:23.440
Wan was lucky enough

04:24.440 --> 04:25.720
to survive this.

04:26.440 --> 04:29.120
But the child was taken away
right after he was born.

04:30.160 --> 04:33.560
After that, Lady Yue settled the payment.

04:33.640 --> 04:35.000
This matter was over.

04:35.680 --> 04:36.560
Wan.

04:37.280 --> 04:38.240
Wan.

04:40.240 --> 04:42.360
Wan… You finally came back.

04:45.080 --> 04:46.120
Renyi.

04:47.560 --> 04:48.640
You really recovered.

04:49.800 --> 04:50.640
Yes, I did.

04:50.720 --> 04:51.960
I'm fine now.

04:52.600 --> 04:53.760
Wan.

04:53.840 --> 04:56.200
Sun Renyi was cured.

04:56.280 --> 04:57.800
We lost the child.

04:58.320 --> 05:00.840
But Wan collapsed.

05:02.360 --> 05:05.000
She couldn't conceive a child for years.

05:05.760 --> 05:07.320
It's okay, Wan.

05:08.840 --> 05:10.000
It's okay.

05:10.520 --> 05:12.240
Slowly,

05:12.880 --> 05:15.480
Wan's in-laws began to despise her.

05:15.560 --> 05:16.640
Fortunately,

05:16.720 --> 05:19.680
- Sun Renyi remained nice to her.
- Renyi.

05:20.360 --> 05:21.200
Until…

05:22.360 --> 05:23.760
Mother. What's wrong?

05:25.160 --> 05:26.280
Mother.

05:26.360 --> 05:27.320
You know what?

05:27.400 --> 05:29.520
Your wife had a child with someone else.

05:29.600 --> 05:30.720
What?

05:31.320 --> 05:32.960
Mother. Is that true?

05:33.040 --> 05:34.160
Mother.

05:34.760 --> 05:36.000
Only then did Wan realize

05:36.080 --> 05:39.040
that her in-laws had always been informed.

05:39.920 --> 05:41.800
They let her bear someone else's child

05:42.440 --> 05:44.440
to save their own son.

05:45.320 --> 05:48.600
And once they realized
she could no longer give birth,

05:49.440 --> 05:52.440
they didn't even want to hide
the truth from Sun Renyi anymore.

05:53.320 --> 05:54.360
Renyi.

05:55.000 --> 05:56.200
Where are you going?

05:57.360 --> 05:58.360
Renyi.

05:59.120 --> 06:01.320
We'll have a child.

06:01.840 --> 06:03.880
I promise.

06:06.000 --> 06:07.000
Don't you remember?

06:07.680 --> 06:08.600
You have a child.

06:12.240 --> 06:13.440
Renyi.

06:16.200 --> 06:19.560
All her sacrifices became her sin.

06:23.800 --> 06:25.000
After that,

06:26.880 --> 06:30.720
Wan kind of lost it.

06:31.400 --> 06:33.360
She wanted to find her child.

06:33.880 --> 06:36.240
I don't know
whether fate was toying with her.

06:36.840 --> 06:39.080
She actually found Wu Siping.

06:39.160 --> 06:41.200
After she saw Wu Mujin,

06:42.600 --> 06:44.120
she had a mental breakdown.

06:44.200 --> 06:46.320
Because she grew up beside me.

06:46.400 --> 06:49.400
She knew the formation
Wu Siping set up for the child.

06:49.480 --> 06:51.360
She felt guilty.

06:51.440 --> 06:53.800
She wanted to take the child away.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.920
But the Wu's Manor was heavily guarded.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.320
She didn't have a chance.

06:58.120 --> 06:59.600
Following her failed attempts,

07:01.840 --> 07:06.040
the Suns locked her in the woodshed.

07:06.680 --> 07:09.280
The woman who approached you
wanted you to take revenge.

07:09.880 --> 07:12.920
Xu Daoyin and Lady Yue
harmed too many people.

07:13.560 --> 07:17.440
Who among those who survived
wouldn't want revenge?

07:18.040 --> 07:18.960
She helped you?

07:20.240 --> 07:21.200
I didn't need it.

07:32.240 --> 07:34.880
Xu Daoyin's petty tricks

07:37.160 --> 07:39.720
only earned him some recognition.

07:40.320 --> 07:44.360
And the one who truly
helped him become famous was me.

07:45.920 --> 07:47.960
That head-separation technique

07:48.480 --> 07:52.280
made his reputation
spread far beyond Mingzhou.

07:52.360 --> 07:53.680
People came

07:53.760 --> 07:57.760
even from counties
near the Western Capital,

07:57.840 --> 07:59.800
offering him a huge fortune.

08:00.480 --> 08:02.840
I gained his trust

08:03.360 --> 08:05.600
and gradually figured out
the secrets of the manor.

08:05.680 --> 08:09.960
Xu Daoyin was doing shady business

08:10.040 --> 08:12.200
with those merchants and nobles.

08:12.720 --> 08:15.360
Liu San was Xu Daoyin's confidant.

08:15.440 --> 08:17.720
He helped Xu Daoyin

08:18.520 --> 08:21.800
complete the head-separation trick

08:21.880 --> 08:23.160
and helped him

08:24.120 --> 08:27.200
lure those girls from poor families

08:27.280 --> 08:30.720
to willingly
become his reproductive tools.

08:31.240 --> 08:35.440
Lady Yue made sure those children
were born at the designated hours.

08:47.960 --> 08:50.560
I've seen too many girls
at the Vitality Hall.

08:51.400 --> 08:54.000
Each one was just like Wan.

08:55.400 --> 08:57.280
Some saw the newborns die.

08:58.440 --> 09:00.520
Some were physically broken.

09:01.560 --> 09:02.960
Some died giving birth.

09:03.720 --> 09:07.480
I approached Xu Daoyin to get revenge.

09:07.560 --> 09:08.560
But then I realized

09:08.640 --> 09:13.720
that I had somehow become an accomplice.

09:14.600 --> 09:16.440
If I didn't do anything about it,

09:17.360 --> 09:19.640
I had no idea how many more would suffer.

09:25.120 --> 09:27.640
I started planning for revenge.

09:28.560 --> 09:30.480
While adjusting the mechanism,

09:31.400 --> 09:33.360
I was persuading Xu Daoyin

09:34.600 --> 09:38.160
to build secret passages in the manor
to meet with his distinguished clients.

09:39.680 --> 09:41.280
That allowed me

09:42.200 --> 09:44.760
to go around the manor in secret.

09:49.880 --> 09:54.560
You know the rest of the story.

10:01.080 --> 10:02.880
Your mechanism was not perfect.

10:02.960 --> 10:03.960
You moved the timeline up.

10:04.760 --> 10:05.600
That's right.

10:05.680 --> 10:08.600
Wu Siping was not pleased
with his business.

10:09.120 --> 10:11.440
Xu Daoyin told him to have
another child through surrogacy.

10:11.520 --> 10:13.920
You were worried
that Wu Mujin would be replaced.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.200
He wanted to kill Wu Mujin.

10:29.200 --> 10:30.280
Follow the great men

10:31.240 --> 10:32.600
and let go of the weak.

10:32.680 --> 10:36.480
You will gain what you seek
and remain steadfast.

10:37.360 --> 10:39.560
Let go… Let go of the weak?

10:39.640 --> 10:43.440
But that child
supposedly brings me fortune.

10:43.520 --> 10:45.000
Everyone has their fate.

10:45.880 --> 10:49.960
Maybe this is the fate for the two of you
as father and son.

10:50.040 --> 10:54.160
If the old does not go away,
how will you welcome the new?

10:54.880 --> 10:56.200
Are you saying

10:57.680 --> 10:59.600
that I should ask for another son?

10:59.680 --> 11:02.200
I only read what the hexagrams show.

11:02.280 --> 11:05.760
I won't interfere with your choice.

11:06.720 --> 11:10.080
However, there is an auspicious time
for childbirth.

11:10.160 --> 11:11.920
Make up your mind soon.

11:15.560 --> 11:17.960
Hexagrams never
tell anyone to hurt others.

11:18.040 --> 11:19.840
But people exploit it
to manipulate others.

11:20.720 --> 11:23.040
But Wu Siping didn't think so.

11:23.640 --> 11:25.360
He wanted something.

11:25.960 --> 11:28.440
Naturally, he believed in the hexagrams.

11:28.520 --> 11:30.920
The teaching says
that good deeds bring blessings.

11:31.520 --> 11:33.920
They do evil,
yet hope for good retribution.

11:34.480 --> 11:35.480
How absurd.

11:35.560 --> 11:38.960
He was planning to do it
after the child was born.

11:44.240 --> 11:46.120
I had to get ahead of him.

11:46.840 --> 11:50.360
I entered the Wu's Manor
to send the invitation

11:51.320 --> 11:52.560
to the Heaven-Inquiry Ceremony.

12:18.520 --> 12:21.080
GREAT VIRTUE TO EMBRACE THE WORLD

12:49.040 --> 12:51.160
I decided from the beginning

12:51.240 --> 12:55.640
that I wouldn't let him die
without a taste of pain.

12:58.200 --> 13:02.680
He must suffer what Wan had suffered.

13:04.360 --> 13:07.000
I didn't replace the incense in his room.

13:12.560 --> 13:13.640
Who are you?

13:14.160 --> 13:15.560
What do you want?

13:15.640 --> 13:17.040
Put me down.

13:19.960 --> 13:20.880
Recognize me?

13:21.760 --> 13:23.080
It's you.

13:24.200 --> 13:26.360
You're with that crazy woman.

13:29.080 --> 13:31.320
Guards. Guards.

13:31.400 --> 13:32.280
Guards.

13:32.800 --> 13:34.200
Guards.

13:40.640 --> 13:41.800
What did you feed me?

13:42.720 --> 13:45.080
Do you know that murder
is a capital offense?

13:45.680 --> 13:46.960
Lay a finger on me

13:47.520 --> 13:49.960
and I won't let you
and that crazy woman off!

14:16.960 --> 14:17.840
What are you doing?

14:19.200 --> 14:20.880
You're crazy.

14:20.960 --> 14:22.440
Madman!

14:22.520 --> 14:25.000
Too many questions for a madman.

14:25.080 --> 14:27.520
- Put me down. Guards.
- What answers do you expect?

14:28.200 --> 14:29.160
Guards.

14:29.240 --> 14:31.240
What answers do you expect?

14:37.560 --> 14:39.520
What answers do you expect?

14:49.040 --> 14:50.080
After that,

14:51.360 --> 14:53.280
I rushed back to the manor overnight

14:53.800 --> 14:54.960
and adjusted the mechanism

14:55.040 --> 14:59.160
to kill Liu San and abduct Xu Daoyin
at the Heaven-Inquiry Ceremony.

14:59.240 --> 15:01.640
I hid Xu Daoyin in the secret passage.

15:01.720 --> 15:03.960
I was going to kill him.

15:05.520 --> 15:09.880
But I found gold ingots that he cherished
in the secret chamber.

15:10.520 --> 15:12.080
So I changed my mind.

15:13.400 --> 15:14.440
Death

15:16.360 --> 15:18.360
is too easy for him.

15:18.440 --> 15:22.040
Wu Lie infiltrated the Vitality Hall
with your help, didn't he?

15:22.720 --> 15:25.320
Otherwise, he couldn't have found anyone
in the formation.

15:26.000 --> 15:28.520
None of you could save anyone.

15:28.600 --> 15:31.760
You asked Wu Lie
to make a noise outside the chamber

15:32.360 --> 15:35.920
and lead us to the Vitality Hall
to save people?

15:36.000 --> 15:37.720
If you can save people,

15:38.240 --> 15:41.040
why would you care about my motives?

15:41.120 --> 15:43.240
If you fail to save people,

15:43.760 --> 15:46.760
what's so important about my motives?

15:48.360 --> 15:50.000
I just don't like being used.

15:51.960 --> 15:53.520
I killed him.

15:54.040 --> 15:55.160
I plead guilty.

15:55.800 --> 15:57.480
To avenge your daughter,

15:57.560 --> 16:00.200
killing these few people can't be enough.

16:07.280 --> 16:09.840
Your Ladyship.
I almost forgot if you didn't mention it.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.640
The yamen has records.

16:12.160 --> 16:14.160
Three years ago, Sun Renyi got remarried.

16:14.240 --> 16:16.600
On the wedding night,
the house caught fire and collapsed.

16:16.680 --> 16:19.400
Except for the bride
waiting in the wedding chamber,

16:19.920 --> 16:21.640
all three members of the Sun family died.

16:23.760 --> 16:25.960
The wedding night

16:26.560 --> 16:29.480
matches perfectly with the raging flames,

16:30.080 --> 16:31.880
doesn't it?

16:33.840 --> 16:34.960
Wan.

16:35.040 --> 16:36.040
Wan.

16:37.280 --> 16:39.040
Wan.

16:39.120 --> 16:39.960
Wan.

16:40.040 --> 16:42.240
I am so sorry.

16:42.320 --> 16:44.160
Wan.

16:44.240 --> 16:46.760
I am so sorry. Wan.

16:46.840 --> 16:48.920
I was wrong.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.640
I am so sorry.

16:54.720 --> 16:56.440
Wan is dead.

16:57.880 --> 16:59.960
Stop putting on a show.

17:01.880 --> 17:05.880
Xiao. We're sorry about Wan, too.

17:05.960 --> 17:09.359
Renyi was going to spend
the rest of his life with Wan

17:09.440 --> 17:11.359
once she recovered.

17:12.480 --> 17:13.680
You lost your daughter.

17:13.760 --> 17:15.359
We lost our daughter-in-law.

17:15.440 --> 17:16.720
We share your sorrow.

17:16.800 --> 17:19.119
Please stop blaming us.

17:21.119 --> 17:22.440
What do you want?

17:25.160 --> 17:26.000
Mr. Xiao.

17:27.200 --> 17:29.440
We came here to tell you

17:29.520 --> 17:33.320
that we want to bury Wan
in our ancestral grave.

17:33.400 --> 17:36.000
Wan has married into the Sun family.

17:36.080 --> 17:39.600
She can't be buried
in your ancestral grave.

17:39.680 --> 17:42.760
But we can't bear to leave her
lying in the wilderness

17:42.840 --> 17:44.840
all by herself.

17:45.440 --> 17:46.600
Mr. Xiao.

17:46.680 --> 17:49.720
BELOVED DAUGHTER XIAO WAN

17:56.200 --> 17:57.400
Father-in-law.

17:57.920 --> 18:01.640
I can't bear to leave her alone,
Father-in-law.

18:01.720 --> 18:04.680
Let me take Wan home.

18:06.160 --> 18:08.360
Father-in-law.
Think of it as my atonement.

18:08.440 --> 18:10.720
Please, Father-in-law.

18:11.600 --> 18:13.840
Please, Father-in-law.

18:16.720 --> 18:18.120
Father-in-law.

18:19.600 --> 18:20.920
What are you waiting for?

18:21.000 --> 18:22.360
Take Wan home now.

18:22.440 --> 18:24.320
That's right. Take Wan home.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.640
- Take Wan home.
- Thank you.

18:27.240 --> 18:28.560
Thank you, Father-in-law.

18:31.280 --> 18:32.800
Come on. Alright.

18:32.880 --> 18:34.080
Let's go home, Wan.

18:35.920 --> 18:37.920
You still had hopes for the Suns.

18:40.080 --> 18:42.360
I sensed something
was off that very night.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.640
- Freeze.
- Stop!

18:48.720 --> 18:49.840
Freeze.

18:54.520 --> 18:55.400
Freeze. Stop running.

18:55.480 --> 18:56.640
Freeze.

19:33.720 --> 19:34.800
XIAO

19:39.280 --> 19:40.160
Who are you?

19:40.240 --> 19:41.360
ZHAO JINGQIAN, XIAO WAN

19:41.440 --> 19:43.600
- What happened…
- Who are you?

19:43.680 --> 19:45.200
What are you doing?

19:45.800 --> 19:47.280
- This is my daughter.
- Who is this madman?

19:47.360 --> 19:48.720
- This is my daughter.
- Hold him down. Beat him.

19:48.800 --> 19:50.240
- Beat him.
- Beat him.

19:50.320 --> 19:52.440
- This is my daughter.
- Ignore him. Go on.

19:52.520 --> 19:53.440
Hurry up. Bury them.

19:53.520 --> 19:56.360
- My daughter.
- Beat him.

19:58.080 --> 19:59.760
My daughter!

19:59.840 --> 20:01.440
- They said
- Wan!

20:02.040 --> 20:05.280
that they paid a lot of money
for this ghost marriage.

20:05.920 --> 20:07.480
I wanted to get my daughter back.

20:07.560 --> 20:09.880
But I couldn't fight so many of them.

20:10.400 --> 20:11.360
Then I…

20:11.880 --> 20:14.320
- Thanks.
- I rushed to the Sun's Manor

20:14.400 --> 20:16.480
for an explanation, only to find that…

20:16.560 --> 20:17.680
Come on.

20:17.760 --> 20:18.760
Drink.

20:18.840 --> 20:19.680
Alright.

20:19.760 --> 20:20.680
Dig in.

20:21.280 --> 20:22.400
- Congratulations.
- Thank you.

20:22.480 --> 20:23.560
Thanks.

20:23.640 --> 20:26.760
It turns out they sold Wan's body

20:28.280 --> 20:31.600
for Sun Renyi to remarry someone else.

20:33.320 --> 20:35.560
When Wan was alive,

20:36.600 --> 20:39.520
she gave up everything to treat him.

20:39.600 --> 20:42.960
After she died, they even
exploited her body.

20:44.160 --> 20:47.840
Those monsters deserved to die.

20:50.640 --> 20:53.760
Father. That was 68 qian in total.

20:55.040 --> 20:56.240
Alright.

20:56.320 --> 20:57.680
There is brocade and something.

20:57.760 --> 20:59.080
Alright.

21:00.280 --> 21:01.440
Look at this.

21:02.360 --> 21:04.200
That's enough even for my grandson.

21:04.720 --> 21:06.720
- So heavy.
- Yeah.

21:06.800 --> 21:07.640
Renyi.

21:08.360 --> 21:10.240
My love. M-My love.

22:03.520 --> 22:04.920
That's the whole story.

22:06.200 --> 22:07.960
Your Ladyship.

22:08.040 --> 22:09.680
You can convict me.

22:11.880 --> 22:13.520
Conviction is not my job.

22:15.560 --> 22:17.240
But you didn't confess everything.

22:19.040 --> 22:20.800
One murder gets you the death penalty.

22:21.640 --> 22:23.640
Ten murders won't change that.

22:24.560 --> 22:26.000
Your Ladyship.

22:26.080 --> 22:28.040
Why would I hide anything?

22:30.600 --> 22:34.360
Even if you could replace
the incense in the Wu's Manor

22:34.440 --> 22:36.240
and kill Wu Siping in his room,

22:36.320 --> 22:39.760
you couldn't have known who we were

22:39.840 --> 22:41.320
to switch our incense.

22:41.960 --> 22:45.960
You know you've been exposed
and would get arrested.

22:46.040 --> 22:48.840
Why did you go back to the Wu's Manor
just to get caught?

22:49.440 --> 22:52.840
You're trying to save someone
at the cost of your life.

22:57.400 --> 22:58.520
Confess.

22:58.600 --> 22:59.600
Who is your accomplice?

23:00.240 --> 23:01.680
I have no accomplices.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.240
Still denying it?

23:08.960 --> 23:09.800
Your Ladyship,

23:09.880 --> 23:14.360
perhaps a little interrogation

23:14.440 --> 23:15.520
will make him talk.

23:15.600 --> 23:17.320
He's not even afraid of death.

23:17.840 --> 23:19.160
Why would he be scared of torture?

23:19.800 --> 23:22.480
Besides, such a minor issue
is easy to look into.

23:24.880 --> 23:26.040
I see.

23:26.960 --> 23:30.680
His accomplice is right at Wu's Manor.

23:38.040 --> 23:38.880
Mujin.

23:39.480 --> 23:40.560
It was me.

23:41.080 --> 23:42.480
Why did you come here?

23:42.560 --> 23:43.640
He came to confess.

23:43.720 --> 23:45.040
He's just a kid.

23:45.120 --> 23:46.080
What's there to confess?

23:46.680 --> 23:48.920
He was Xiao's accomplice?

23:49.000 --> 23:50.040
No, it wasn't him.

23:50.120 --> 23:51.080
Madam Wu.

23:51.160 --> 23:54.400
Wu Mujin suffered a lot and was misled

23:55.000 --> 23:56.680
to replace the incense and lead the way.

23:56.760 --> 23:59.920
He is too young
to distinguish right from wrong.

24:00.000 --> 24:03.280
He needs someone
to take care of him and teach him.

24:03.360 --> 24:06.120
Otherwise, he will face
many difficulties in life.

24:08.080 --> 24:09.400
What do you think, Madam Wu?

24:19.280 --> 24:21.400
I apologize. I deserve punishment.

24:22.520 --> 24:23.360
No.

24:26.480 --> 24:28.360
What do you think, Your Ladyship?

24:29.080 --> 24:30.840
Your Ladyship. Your Ladyship.

24:30.920 --> 24:33.520
Mujin has nothing to do with it.

24:33.600 --> 24:35.680
Please think twice.

24:39.240 --> 24:40.120
Magistrate Wen, it's your call.

24:46.040 --> 24:47.120
Wu Mujin.

24:47.720 --> 24:51.320
You are just a child who got instigated.

24:53.560 --> 24:55.320
I can spare you the penalty.

24:55.960 --> 24:57.080
Madam Wu.

24:57.680 --> 25:00.000
Please take him back

25:00.600 --> 25:01.760
and guide him well.

25:01.840 --> 25:03.360
Thank you, Magistrate Wen.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.960
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

25:08.520 --> 25:09.640
Your Ladyship.

25:10.680 --> 25:14.200
Wu Siping was your uncle, after all.

25:14.280 --> 25:17.160
The case was solved
by the Palace Investigation Bureau

25:17.240 --> 25:18.600
and the Court of Judicial Review.

25:19.200 --> 25:20.800
Could you please

25:20.880 --> 25:23.840
take the perpetrator
back to the Western Capital?

25:23.920 --> 25:26.400
I… I am seriously…

25:26.480 --> 25:27.640
In that case,

25:28.160 --> 25:31.080
Prosecutor Gu and Wuren will take him
back to the Western Capital?

25:32.600 --> 25:34.080
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

25:34.160 --> 25:35.960
Thank you, Prosecutor.

25:52.360 --> 25:55.280
I'm the one who told Xiao everything.

25:55.360 --> 25:57.240
But you wanted to save Wu Mujin.

25:57.760 --> 26:00.640
You also led Xiao to reunite
with the child.

26:03.440 --> 26:06.040
Yi'en. Go play.

26:06.760 --> 26:07.760
Yi'en?

26:08.600 --> 26:11.400
Mother said
that I'll be Xiao Yi'en from now on.

26:22.600 --> 26:24.720
I'm not excusing myself.

26:25.920 --> 26:30.000
But Wu Siping's death
was his own retribution.

26:30.080 --> 26:32.360
He brought this upon himself.

26:32.960 --> 26:35.000
Before Wu Siping left the Western Capital,

26:35.080 --> 26:37.960
His Majesty suffered from a relapse
of his old illness.

26:38.040 --> 26:40.840
None of the physicians could do anything.

26:40.920 --> 26:43.640
Lady Xie happened
to give birth to a prince.

26:44.160 --> 26:46.440
And His Majesty was suddenly cured.

26:48.000 --> 26:49.160
The Astronomical Bureau discovered

26:49.240 --> 26:52.360
that the young prince's Four Pillars
of Destiny match His Majesty's.

26:52.440 --> 26:53.600
That expelled the illness.

26:54.200 --> 26:55.800
His Majesty was overjoyed.

26:55.880 --> 26:58.360
He praised Lady Xie for bringing him luck

26:58.440 --> 27:00.320
and the young prince as a blessing.

27:00.400 --> 27:03.440
He rewarded them handsomely.

27:06.800 --> 27:10.120
Wu Siping had rashes frequently

27:10.200 --> 27:12.240
and couldn't find a cure.

27:12.320 --> 27:14.120
After he resigned and came here,

27:14.720 --> 27:17.360
he decided to follow
the example and find blessings.

27:17.960 --> 27:20.040
That's why everything happened.

27:21.160 --> 27:22.040
But his chronic illness

27:22.760 --> 27:25.760
indeed went away after Yi'en was born.

27:28.800 --> 27:30.800
So it's partly
the Astronomical Bureau's fault.

27:31.800 --> 27:33.360
His Majesty got better

27:33.440 --> 27:35.800
thanks to the Imperial Medical Office's
hard work.

27:35.880 --> 27:40.000
Wu Siping's rash cleared up
mainly due to the local climate.

27:40.080 --> 27:42.720
The so-called blessing was just nonsense.

27:43.320 --> 27:44.440
I stand by what I said.

27:44.520 --> 27:46.600
The celestial phenomena
follow a certain pattern.

27:46.680 --> 27:50.520
Only wicked people
make a big fuss about it for profit.

27:56.040 --> 27:58.280
My uncle was never superstitious.

27:58.920 --> 28:01.040
But he ended up claiming lives

28:01.120 --> 28:04.840
and bringing misfortune to a child
for personal gain.

28:05.520 --> 28:08.200
And this kid is his biological son.

28:09.560 --> 28:14.040
Some can exploit their own children
in their pursuit of wealth and status.

28:15.040 --> 28:16.760
Others, bound by familial ties,

28:17.360 --> 28:20.640
can endure humiliation and hardship
for the sake of revenge.

28:22.000 --> 28:26.360
Yet some still step forward
to protect strangers,

28:26.440 --> 28:27.720
driven by innate compassion.

28:29.680 --> 28:34.080
Becoming a demon or a Buddha
hinges on that fleeting moment of choice.

28:35.800 --> 28:36.720
Your Ladyship.

28:37.440 --> 28:39.080
This butterfly lost a wing.

28:39.160 --> 28:40.360
It can no longer fly.

28:45.600 --> 28:46.760
But it's still alive.

28:47.280 --> 28:49.120
So, there is still hope.

28:49.800 --> 28:50.760
You saved it.

28:50.840 --> 28:53.240
You'll take good care of it. Right?

28:54.280 --> 28:56.960
It can't fly anymore.
But I'll keep it alive.

29:00.720 --> 29:03.640
I'll find you a ceramic jar
to be its home. Alright?

29:11.920 --> 29:13.160
What happened to your hand?

29:14.000 --> 29:16.040
I scratched it while saving the butterfly.

29:20.480 --> 29:22.040
I'm fine. It doesn't hurt.

29:22.640 --> 29:26.040
Wounds must be treated promptly
to heal more quickly.

29:35.240 --> 29:38.280
It becomes a scar if left unattended.

29:46.120 --> 29:51.600
GREAT VIRTUE TO EMBRACE THE WORLD

29:51.680 --> 29:52.760
Your Ladyship.

29:55.320 --> 29:57.000
Are you waiting for me?

29:57.600 --> 29:58.440
Yes.

29:58.960 --> 30:00.400
I want to ask you something.

30:01.400 --> 30:03.400
You saved me.

30:03.480 --> 30:05.640
I will tell you everything I know.

30:06.800 --> 30:08.800
Why did Wu Siping leave the capital?

30:08.880 --> 30:12.360
He claimed to be ill
and asked for resignation.

30:12.440 --> 30:14.400
But I know it was not his intention.

30:14.480 --> 30:16.760
He was the Crown Prince's
Left Guard Commander.

30:16.840 --> 30:18.200
The Crown Prince asked him to resign?

30:18.920 --> 30:20.040
No way.

30:20.120 --> 30:22.600
The Crown Prince was infuriated
by his sudden resignation.

30:22.680 --> 30:24.160
But he was determined to leave.

30:25.120 --> 30:29.480
Where was he on the night
of my family's tragedy 15 years ago?

30:34.440 --> 30:35.440
He was there?

30:36.600 --> 30:37.720
No.

30:39.280 --> 30:42.040
He wasn't on duty that night.

30:42.560 --> 30:43.400
But…

30:45.800 --> 30:46.880
WU'S MANOR

30:55.600 --> 30:57.720
Gather your men.
Come to the Prince of Duan's manor.

30:57.800 --> 30:59.400
- Now?
- Yes.

30:59.480 --> 31:00.600
Does His Highness know?

31:00.680 --> 31:02.640
I will report to him.

31:03.400 --> 31:05.840
But… isn't it against the rules?

31:06.960 --> 31:09.000
If you don't go,
give me the command tally.

31:09.080 --> 31:11.200
I'd say I snatched it from you.

31:11.280 --> 31:12.360
You won't get into trouble.

31:15.280 --> 31:16.480
Hurry up.

31:21.680 --> 31:25.440
Grand Tutor. What on earth is this for?

31:28.200 --> 31:30.160
The less you know, the safer you are.

31:44.840 --> 31:47.040
Not long after that night,

31:47.120 --> 31:49.440
Wu Siping claimed to be ill and resigned.

31:49.520 --> 31:54.400
He never mentioned
what happened that night.

31:55.880 --> 31:58.880
Are you sure it was Xiao Wenyuan
who took the command tally?

31:59.400 --> 32:00.880
He said he was going
to the Prince of Duan's manor?

32:00.960 --> 32:02.080
Yes.

32:02.640 --> 32:04.520
I saw and heard them clearly.

32:07.000 --> 32:09.520
Do you still remember
when Xiao Wenyuan came by?

32:10.920 --> 32:15.040
I really can't remember the specific time.

32:15.120 --> 32:18.520
But it must have been before midnight.

32:19.760 --> 32:20.920
Before midnight?

32:24.120 --> 32:25.640
Before midnight.

32:27.320 --> 32:28.280
Your Ladyship.

32:30.680 --> 32:32.080
Run.

32:41.560 --> 32:43.000
Guards.

32:45.240 --> 32:46.760
Guards.

32:46.840 --> 32:47.920
Guards.

33:00.400 --> 33:01.240
Madam.

33:04.120 --> 33:06.200
Protect Her Ladyship and Madam. Let's go.

33:40.520 --> 33:41.240
Be careful.

33:52.680 --> 33:53.840
Wu Lie. Take Madam away.

33:53.920 --> 33:54.920
They came for me.

33:55.680 --> 33:57.000
We can't leave you behind.

33:57.080 --> 33:58.320
You're a mother.

33:58.400 --> 33:59.600
It's unfair to die here with me.

33:59.680 --> 34:00.680
Let's go.

34:16.800 --> 34:18.199
So many people?

34:18.280 --> 34:19.199
You must have been terrified.

34:19.280 --> 34:21.120
Your Ladyship is smart.

34:21.199 --> 34:24.120
I'm sure you understand
that the deeper you dig,

34:24.199 --> 34:25.520
the more dangerous it gets.

34:25.600 --> 34:27.880
But you'd better kill me this time.

34:28.520 --> 34:31.760
Otherwise, you and the mastermind
are going to be in trouble.

34:31.840 --> 34:32.719
Kill her.

35:02.120 --> 35:03.720
Any other tricks?

35:07.040 --> 35:08.200
If not,

35:09.320 --> 35:10.400
I'm going to kill you.

35:11.040 --> 35:14.640
If you survive, none of us gets to live.

35:16.000 --> 35:17.440
But I didn't come alone.

35:18.040 --> 35:19.480
Don't try to bluff me.

35:20.120 --> 35:23.160
Gu Lingzhou and Wuren
are heading to the Western Capital.

35:23.240 --> 35:25.640
You only have Xiao Huaijin with you.

35:27.160 --> 35:29.320
How can he do?

35:30.560 --> 35:31.720
Kill her.

35:32.480 --> 35:33.400
Die!

35:40.720 --> 35:41.640
Why did you come?

35:41.720 --> 35:42.880
Madam Wu said you were in danger.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.400
Your Ladyship.

35:56.280 --> 35:57.320
I was careless.

35:58.080 --> 35:59.200
The arrow is poisoned.

36:00.560 --> 36:01.640
Go. Leave me here.

36:06.600 --> 36:09.000
Now is not the time
for dramatic displays of loyalty.

36:09.080 --> 36:10.120
You may die.

36:10.200 --> 36:11.040
It's fine.

36:11.120 --> 36:13.280
I don't have something I have to do.

36:13.360 --> 36:15.000
But I swear I will save you.

36:15.080 --> 36:16.320
My wound hurts.

36:23.160 --> 36:26.120
Forget about knocking me out to die alone.

36:26.200 --> 36:29.520
Either we leave together
or I die with you.

36:29.600 --> 36:32.120
- I won't appreciate you.
- If I wanted to be appreciated,

36:32.200 --> 36:34.160
I wouldn't have chosen to be with you.

36:37.800 --> 36:39.080
Then Mr. Xiao,

36:40.120 --> 36:41.440
let's try to live.

36:44.480 --> 36:45.600
Crazy kiddo.

36:47.920 --> 36:51.480
Without the old man,
you were beaten so badly?

36:52.000 --> 36:53.000
Old man.

36:53.520 --> 36:54.800
Why did you come?

36:54.880 --> 36:56.240
If I don't come now,

36:56.320 --> 36:59.600
I'll go straight to collect your body.

37:15.640 --> 37:19.400
Those losers really want you dead.

37:20.000 --> 37:20.840
Is this poison curable?

37:20.920 --> 37:22.960
My medicine will keep her alive,

37:23.040 --> 37:25.240
but she will suffer.

37:25.320 --> 37:26.400
What do you mean?

37:28.520 --> 37:29.720
Peiyi.

37:30.400 --> 37:31.280
Your Ladyship.

37:31.360 --> 37:33.160
- Inspector Du.
- It's okay.

37:34.160 --> 37:35.400
It's good that she threw up.

37:37.640 --> 37:38.720
Old man.

37:39.480 --> 37:41.080
How do you know I'm in trouble?

37:41.680 --> 37:42.600
Look at you.

37:42.680 --> 37:45.920
You never take my advice to heart.

37:46.000 --> 37:49.000
You didn't even hide the fact
that you came to Mingzhou.

37:49.080 --> 37:51.960
Even I heard about it.
They surely did, too.

37:52.040 --> 37:55.440
Always make it quick
if you want to look into something.

37:55.520 --> 37:56.440
Yet you took your time.

37:56.520 --> 37:58.720
Weren't you inviting
them here to kill you?

38:00.440 --> 38:02.680
You came all the way
from the Western Capital

38:03.360 --> 38:04.640
just to scold me?

38:04.720 --> 38:06.360
You surely need a scolding.

38:13.440 --> 38:15.640
That's enough. Leave it to me.

38:15.720 --> 38:18.960
I'll leave Her Ladyship to you.

38:23.840 --> 38:24.920
There are many of them.

38:25.440 --> 38:26.560
Things might be tricky.

38:26.640 --> 38:29.000
That's why I said leave it to me.

38:30.560 --> 38:31.520
Get going.

38:36.120 --> 38:37.520
Crazy kiddo.

38:37.600 --> 38:39.960
Try to be more careful.

38:40.040 --> 38:42.440
Don't cause your old man more trouble.

38:44.400 --> 38:45.640
I promise.

38:47.160 --> 38:48.520
Get lost.

38:48.600 --> 38:49.600
Take care.

39:19.480 --> 39:20.720
It's you?

39:20.800 --> 39:22.280
You know me?

39:23.280 --> 39:24.800
So we're old friends.

39:25.560 --> 39:27.240
Get out of my way

39:27.320 --> 39:28.680
and I'll spare you.

39:28.760 --> 39:33.080
Since you know who I am,
stop wasting your breath.

39:33.160 --> 39:34.960
- Bring it on.
- Kill him.

39:58.080 --> 40:00.240
I haven't trained for a long time.

40:00.760 --> 40:01.520
This is amazing.

42:02.720 --> 42:04.360
You old fox.

42:04.440 --> 42:05.400
Tricking me into revealing my moves?

42:05.480 --> 42:07.080
Otherwise,

42:07.160 --> 42:10.360
how do I find out
which old friend you are?

42:34.440 --> 42:35.680
Despicable as expected.

42:37.360 --> 42:38.440
We're not done yet.

42:55.160 --> 42:56.480
- The blade is poisoned.
- You can't go.

42:56.560 --> 42:58.040
If Inspector Du can't make it,

42:58.120 --> 43:00.200
you'll only die there with him.

43:00.280 --> 43:01.360
I'd rather die with him.

43:01.440 --> 43:04.000
You promised him to live well.

43:06.560 --> 43:07.880
It's hard to live,

43:09.440 --> 43:10.280
but easy to die.

43:26.320 --> 43:27.520
Sorry.

43:27.600 --> 43:29.240
I have to keep you alive.
